WEBVTT

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:44.660
H-Hot!

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:56.000
So, Coach Mitaka suddenly decided
to come with us?

00:01:56.300 --> 00:02:00.210
Yup. He said it's 'cause
Big Brother Godai's going.

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:02.660
You called him, didn't you?

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:07.980
I thought it'd be nicer to go
in a car than on a train.

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:09.620
Right, Godai?

00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:28.150
Good morning!

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:31.110
-Good morning!
-Good morning!

00:02:32.910 --> 00:02:35.110
Ms. Otonashi
why don't you sit up' front?

00:02:35.440 --> 00:02:36.900
I'm okay in the back.

00:02:37.710 --> 00:02:38.770
Thank you...

00:02:39.150 --> 00:02:43.150
for going to rent the van
so early in the morning.

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:46.780
No problem. It's a man's job.

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:53.620
Coming?

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:41.770
Your turn, Kentaro.

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:49.080
What're you laughing at?

00:03:49.380 --> 00:03:50.250
Pick a card.

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:17.480
Kinda fun, isn't it?

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:18.970
You think so?

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:20.600
It's your turn, Auntie.

00:04:22.020 --> 00:04:22.620
Okay.

00:04:26.890 --> 00:04:28.820
Yeah! I win!

00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:31.160
Shucks...

00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:36.750
Big Brother! Wanna play cards?

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.470
There's room for one more
back here.

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:39.300
Right here.

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:44.820
We're almost there.

00:04:46.270 --> 00:04:47.000
All right.

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:48.980
When we get there, teach me
how to skate, okay?

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:52.120
I wanna learn, too.

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:56.180
Uh... I'm not that good.

00:04:56.750 --> 00:05:00.620
Why don't you ask Coach Mitaka?
He'd be a better teacher.

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:03.810
C'mon, Godai. Don't be so modest.

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:06.350
You were born in snow country,
weren't you?

00:05:06.670 --> 00:05:09.160
You'd be much better than I
at winter sports.

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:12.300
Oh, no, Mitaka!
You're the athlete!

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:15.370
Stop it, Godai!
I know you're better!

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:17.410
You are, Mitaka!

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:23.680
They're acting mighty strange.

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:24.540
Uh-huh.

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:27.490
You're both trying to avoid us!

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:31.750
Yeah. I bet they want
to skate with Auntie Kyoko.

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:35.140
I won't let him.

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:37.870
If only he weren't here.

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:05.680
If you don't have John Wilson,
I'll take Schaefer.

00:06:05.860 --> 00:06:07.220
Never heard of 'em.

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:08.930
What? Never?

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:12.450
They're both very famous
figure skate brands.

00:06:13.130 --> 00:06:14.800
I can't believe you've
never even heard of...

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:19.320
So you want figure skates.
What about you?

00:06:19.610 --> 00:06:21.660
I-I'll take the same.

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:28.110
That's right.

00:06:30.880 --> 00:06:32.370
You're both doing great.

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:35.270
I'm gonna try on my own.

00:06:36.820 --> 00:06:37.850
Sure. Give it a try.

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:41.010
Here I go!

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:45.250
Ouch!

00:06:45.740 --> 00:06:47.730
Let's have her hold
our hands a bit longer.

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:51.120
Like this?

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:53.360
No, like this.

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:55.020
Or maybe like so?

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:02.610
Godai, aren't you going to skate?

00:07:02.990 --> 00:07:04.140
What about you, Mitaka?

00:07:05.490 --> 00:07:06.680
Oh, me?

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:11.220
I bet he's scheming something.

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:13.140
But he's playing it cool.

00:07:21.190 --> 00:07:23.120
Hey! Whatcha doin'?

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:23.970
-Nothing.
-Nothing.

00:07:24.430 --> 00:07:25.190
-Right?
-Right?

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:28.020
Hm... You two are buddies today.

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:29.560
Do I hear sarcasm?

00:07:29.940 --> 00:07:34.110
Who would've guessed?
You're a good skater.

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:37.870
Born 'n raised in Hokkaido!

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:42.140
She was, huh?

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:45.830
Big Brother! Look!

00:07:46.120 --> 00:07:48.220
I can stand on my own!

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:50.660
Aren't you two going to skate?

00:07:50.730 --> 00:07:52.880
Finals are over!
Go wack-o!

00:07:53.970 --> 00:07:57.060
Where do you learn
to say things like that?!

00:07:58.930 --> 00:08:00.230
Too bad, isn't it?

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:03.330
The manager's spending
all her time with the kids.

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:04.810
Well...

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:07.410
C'mon! Get off your butts!

00:08:09.010 --> 00:08:11.110
Let's go, Big Brother!

00:08:12.180 --> 00:08:15.630
Your sour faces are going
to scare away the manager.

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:17.010
C'mon!

00:08:37.770 --> 00:08:39.130
You're kiddin', right?

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:40.440
It's true.

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:44.170
Who woulda guessed.
Godai, I could see...

00:08:44.950 --> 00:08:46.240
Whaddaya mean?!

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:48.760
So you can't skate?

00:08:49.150 --> 00:08:52.820
You sounded so confident
so I just assumed...

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:54.950
What do you mean?

00:08:56.020 --> 00:08:57.460
I told you...

00:08:57.570 --> 00:08:58.460
that I'm...

00:08:58.520 --> 00:08:59.220
not...

00:08:59.290 --> 00:08:59.880
that...

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:01.360
good...

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:04.130
You can't skate at all!

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:11.390
Mitaka, you were talking like
you were a pro or something.

00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:14.440
Knowledge and ability
are two separate issues.

00:09:15.140 --> 00:09:17.110
Why did you come, then?

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:20.670
What? If we can't skate
we can't be here?

00:09:21.250 --> 00:09:23.190
You sound bitter.

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:25.220
No, I'm not.

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:28.770
Ms. Otonashi, will you coach me?

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:29.750
Huh?

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:36.280
M-Manager, me too!
Please teach me, too!

00:09:37.570 --> 00:09:41.500
Godai, you can stand on your feet
without hanging onto anything.

00:09:42.130 --> 00:09:45.100
I wouldn't consider this "standing."

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:48.270
You two really can't skate?

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:50.080
As you can see--

00:09:50.220 --> 00:09:51.480
We can't skate.

00:09:51.850 --> 00:09:54.440
You're gonna pretend to fall
and throw yourself on her, right?

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:55.480
Please...

00:09:56.460 --> 00:09:57.620
Mrs. Ichinose!

00:09:58.230 --> 00:09:59.210
Now, there's an idea.

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:00.950
Brilliant plan.

00:10:02.420 --> 00:10:03.690
I have no ulterior motives.

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:10.190
You think my ego would let me
pretend I can't skate?

00:10:12.980 --> 00:10:14.840
Why don't I teach you?

00:10:14.980 --> 00:10:15.800
No thanks.

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:35.770
HOKARONI
[Hand Warmer]

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:42.590
I'll watch Kentaro and Ikuko.

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:43.280
-Yes!
-Yes!

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:54.300
Well, is it time?

00:10:54.820 --> 00:10:55.670
I guess.

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:31.840
All right! Come to me!

00:11:32.220 --> 00:11:34.040
Don't be afraid!

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:37.250
Come on...let go of the railing!

00:11:38.490 --> 00:11:42.540
M-Manager! People are watching!

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:45.410
If you're embarrassed, get over here.

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:46.510
Over here!

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:50.730
I feel like a fish in a tank.

00:11:52.400 --> 00:11:57.770
Remember: Stand on the ice.
Do not bring feet together.

00:11:57.950 --> 00:11:59.160
Stand with feet slightly apart.

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:03.580
Balance yourself with
dominant foot slightly in front.

00:12:38.430 --> 00:12:39.990
It's Mr. Yotsuya and Akemi.

00:12:43.670 --> 00:12:46.040
More the merrier, isn't it?

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:49.150
Why didn't they come with us?

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:55.150
Hello. It's me, Yotsuya.

00:12:55.890 --> 00:12:57.410
Is this a bad time?

00:12:57.920 --> 00:12:58.860
It sure is.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:01.450
You're pretty blunt.

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:05.680
P-Please...

00:13:05.770 --> 00:13:07.590
leave me alone for a while.

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:09.220
Me, too.

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:11.950
Fine.

00:13:12.800 --> 00:13:18.270
Mysterious shadow
Glides across the silver ice
Disappears like a swallow

00:13:25.420 --> 00:13:29.250
Come on! If you dilly-dally,
Yotsuya will be back!

00:13:29.820 --> 00:13:30.420
Right.

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:37.580
There!

00:13:39.400 --> 00:13:40.580
Great!

00:13:41.640 --> 00:13:42.960
Coach Mitaka, you too!

00:13:46.570 --> 00:13:48.930
Here's my chance!
Mitaka can't even balance!

00:13:59.760 --> 00:14:00.440
Godai!

00:14:00.760 --> 00:14:02.540
How dare you!

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:05.390
Look...

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:07.050
what I...

00:14:08.060 --> 00:14:08.900
Can...

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:10.710
do...!

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:16.130
Keep going, Godai!

00:14:16.930 --> 00:14:18.160
Manager!

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:22.550
A little more!

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:25.270
Manager...!

00:14:30.710 --> 00:14:32.830
You were leaning too far forward.

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:40.080
My grandma always said men
should always keep charging forward.

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:44.040
Thanks.

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:48.020
Let me give you a hand.

00:14:53.300 --> 00:14:55.900
Godai doesn't like me.

00:15:00.940 --> 00:15:04.750
Mitaka, you'll never be able to skate
if you don't get over your fear.

00:15:05.390 --> 00:15:06.710
I'm so embarrassed.

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:10.940
I slip and slide on ice
with regular shoes on.

00:15:11.320 --> 00:15:13.660
When I think I have to slide
on these shiny blades--

00:15:14.770 --> 00:15:17.050
If you don't slide on them,
you're not skating.

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:19.590
Hold my hand.

00:15:21.670 --> 00:15:23.130
Thank you.

00:15:23.830 --> 00:15:25.950
She's so unfair.

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:29.110
I'm trying so much harder,
and she won't even praise me.

00:15:30.040 --> 00:15:31.090
Fine.

00:15:32.940 --> 00:15:34.640
Straighten up more.

00:15:35.310 --> 00:15:36.010
Yes.

00:15:43.990 --> 00:15:44.610
Oops!

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:48.260
People are watching.

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:51.870
I-I'm sorry.
If I let go now, I'll fall.

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:53.050
Let me hang on
a little bit.

00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:05.170
Um... Can you let go now?

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:08.970
Forgive me.

00:16:09.310 --> 00:16:13.750
Manager! Did he do anything to you?

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:15.170
Godai!

00:16:15.890 --> 00:16:17.040
I swear!

00:16:17.220 --> 00:16:20.420
I didn't intentionally
wrap myself around you.

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:21.970
I know.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:24.660
Why, you...!

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:26.260
Oopsie!

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:29.320
Ms. Otonashi, watch out!

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:31.030
GET OUTTA MY WAY!

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:32.770
DON'T COME THIS WAY!

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:40.870
Bravo, bravo!

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:46.240
Ms. Otonashi, I'm standing!
I'm standing on my own!

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:47.150
Godai!

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:48.410
Ms. Otonashi!

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:51.340
Are you all right?

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:53.790
Don't help him!

00:16:55.770 --> 00:16:57.260
Let him be.

00:16:57.320 --> 00:16:58.120
But...

00:17:00.570 --> 00:17:03.720
Don't bother. You'll spoil him.

00:17:08.230 --> 00:17:10.990
Remember: Walk on ice.

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:13.850
Never let feet off
surface of ice.

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:17.770
Gently glide both feet
forward over ice.

00:17:19.090 --> 00:17:20.170
Right.

00:17:28.100 --> 00:17:30.180
My face is getting frostbitten.

00:17:30.670 --> 00:17:32.900
He's quite stubborn.

00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:34.360
Maybe he's dead.

00:17:35.410 --> 00:17:37.130
Shall I try kicking him?

00:17:37.640 --> 00:17:38.680
Good idea.

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:39.900
Wait!

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:41.410
You're so cruel!

00:17:41.470 --> 00:17:42.960
Poor Big Brother!

00:17:49.650 --> 00:17:51.970
Your cheek's so cold!

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:54.840
Ikuko, you're such a sweet girl.

00:18:05.370 --> 00:18:06.720
OUCH!!

00:18:09.960 --> 00:18:11.160
You, too?

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:12.520
Ignore him.

00:18:13.430 --> 00:18:17.520
You must teach him early
to take care of himself.

00:18:17.810 --> 00:18:20.140
Else he'd end up like Godai.

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:23.230
I guess you're right.

00:18:23.550 --> 00:18:24.310
Hey!

00:18:24.560 --> 00:18:26.650
How could you all be so mean?

00:18:29.590 --> 00:18:31.240
Kentaro, are you all right?

00:18:33.020 --> 00:18:38.480
Let's go practice some more.
I think we've almost got it.

00:18:48.470 --> 00:18:50.570
Hang in there, Kentaro.

00:18:50.910 --> 00:18:52.400
Ms. Otonashi!

00:18:53.470 --> 00:18:55.960
I think I almost got it!
Can you help me?

00:18:56.890 --> 00:18:57.500
Sure.

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:00.580
Godai, let's keep going.

00:19:01.020 --> 00:19:01.780
Right.

00:19:02.060 --> 00:19:03.420
If I don't keep
an eye on him...

00:19:03.480 --> 00:19:06.150
he might throw himself
onto you again.

00:19:08.190 --> 00:19:10.890
I'll protect you with my life!

00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:13.480
What are you talking about?!

00:19:24.770 --> 00:19:28.110
I didn't do it on purpose! I swear!

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:31.730
Everyone's watching. Everyone...

00:19:32.450 --> 00:19:36.010
Godai! How could you?!

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:45.320
It's impossible to teach
two grown men at once.

00:19:45.600 --> 00:19:47.320
I'll take over.

00:19:47.670 --> 00:19:49.680
Then I'll watch the children.

00:19:50.070 --> 00:19:51.330
B-But...

00:19:54.230 --> 00:19:56.750
May I have another?

00:19:58.050 --> 00:20:01.440
Why are you asking me
for permission?

00:20:02.740 --> 00:20:05.670
I see. You don't need me.

00:20:06.620 --> 00:20:10.850
I was going to offer
to watch the children...

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:13.650
but I guess that's not necessary.

00:20:14.330 --> 00:20:18.920
What else would you like to eat?
Order whatever you want!

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:21.490
All right, then. Let's split.

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:25.630
Okay. I can handle one person.

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:27.100
So be it!

00:20:38.680 --> 00:20:40.270
Hurry!

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:42.670
Who's coming to Mama?

00:20:43.950 --> 00:20:45.970
Give us a minute!

00:20:47.950 --> 00:20:50.390
Let's do this fairly.

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:51.950
I wouldn't want it
any other way.

00:20:52.400 --> 00:20:55.510
Whoever reaches
the manager first wins.

00:20:55.840 --> 00:20:56.820
Fine.

00:20:58.080 --> 00:20:59.170
Ready?

00:21:01.550 --> 00:21:02.600
Start!

00:21:08.770 --> 00:21:10.570
What's going on?

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:18.590
I can't lose!
I was born in snow country!

00:21:19.160 --> 00:21:22.320
I can't lose!
I'm a natural athlete!

00:21:26.490 --> 00:21:29.750
I bet one bottle of sake that
Godai gets to her first.

00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:31.630
Three bottles on Mitaka.

00:21:31.700 --> 00:21:34.140
I put two bottles on Godai.

00:21:36.410 --> 00:21:39.990
They're doing fine without you,
Mrs. Ichinose.

00:21:45.620 --> 00:21:47.340
This could work...

00:21:47.590 --> 00:21:50.080
Manager! Hey!

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:52.380
Yes? What is it?

00:21:55.300 --> 00:21:57.250
The finish line moved!

00:21:57.840 --> 00:21:59.170
So what?!

00:22:05.640 --> 00:22:07.680
I see. Okay.

00:22:09.880 --> 00:22:11.310
-The goal!
-The goal!

00:22:13.120 --> 00:22:14.410
Ms. Otonashi!

00:22:14.940 --> 00:22:15.960
She knows.

00:22:16.120 --> 00:22:18.140
Whether she knows or not...

00:22:19.680 --> 00:22:20.510
It's a race!

00:22:20.890 --> 00:22:23.150
Come on! Here I am!

00:22:35.730 --> 00:22:36.570
Go!

00:22:39.970 --> 00:22:42.070
When's it gonna end?

00:22:42.770 --> 00:22:45.530
I bet two bottles that
the manager gives up first!

00:22:45.920 --> 00:22:47.460
I bet three bottles!

00:22:47.550 --> 00:22:51.490
I bet five that neither gets her!

00:22:53.010 --> 00:22:55.000
They sure improved.

00:22:55.560 --> 00:22:58.350
I don't think they need
any more coaching.

00:23:10.260 --> 00:23:11.950
Ms. Otonashi!

00:23:12.140 --> 00:23:14.300
Manager!

00:23:28.330 --> 00:23:31.160
Shall we rest?!

00:23:32.360 --> 00:23:33.910
Ms. Otonashi!

00:23:34.060 --> 00:23:36.450
Manager!

00:23:38.100 --> 00:23:43.830
Needless to say, my body hurt
like hell the next day.

00:23:50.150 --> 00:23:54.390
Please drop by, Manager.

00:23:54.560 --> 00:23:55.910
It'll be my treat.

00:23:56.790 --> 00:24:00.410
Next: "Kyoko's Tied One On!
Man, Is She Plastered!"

00:24:00.490 --> 00:24:04.360
My thirst for free liquor
is unquenchable!
